OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after fire near
OL,4,Atrack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains have been cancelled after a fire
OL,7,Fnear railway tracks.
OL,9,FRoyal Berkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it had received a large number of
OL,11,Fcalls to an incident on Colthrop Lane
OL,12,Fin Thatcham on Monday evening and that
OL,13,Fcrews were on the scene.
OL,15,FIn posts on local Facebook groups,
OL,16,Fresidents reported hearing "explosions"
OL,17,Fcoming from the site of the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
