OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after fire near
OL,4,Atrack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreat Western Railways said it had been
OL,7,Finformed of the incident, and that it
OL,8,Fhad closed the nearby tracks, with no
OL,9,Ftrains travelling through the area for
OL,10,Fthe rest of the evening.
